<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῠερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, but <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρῆς κρυεροῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					657
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύος</span>):—<i>icy, cold,
				chilling</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυεροῖο γόοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.103
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κμυεροῖο φόβοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυεροῦ Ἀΐδαο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					153
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου τελευτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					916.6
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1191
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμος</span>, of the
			grave, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				241.4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>): in the lit. sense,
				<i>icy-cold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. νέκυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					114.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				951
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				955
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.6.1
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
